Changelog: 12-10-2026 08:23:31

install.sh takes the options of every app's installer: --no-desktop-shortcut, --uninstall, --uninstall --purge (the app keeps no settings) and --help, given in any order.

Changelog: 12-10-2026 08:07:21

The window has the suite's header: the icon at 96 px (was 64) beside the title with the version, and the description line below it.

Changelog: 12-10-2026 06:06:00

A double-click on the Desktop icon opened the window twice. The app carries a copy of bc250_core's instance.py now, as the apps that are not on bc250_core do, and a second launch brings the running window to the front and exits.

Changelog: 11-10-2026 18:15:13

A .checkout-only marker: it runs from the checkout and is never released. A portal from a checkout lists it under
Development only.

Changelog: 11-10-2026 18:11:09

Add a desktop GUI for selecting and running installer tests.
Add application and documentation icons.
Add a per-user desktop installer and uninstaller.
Show a green checkmark for passing tests and a red cross for failures.
Prevent duplicate test labels from overlapping the checkbox labels.
Find the Homebrew fakeroot binary when desktop launchers provide a limited PATH.
Keep completed test results visible when starting subsequent runs.
Show the app icon beside the title in the window header.
